      "lineColor": "#DDDDDD",
      "lineWidth": 1.33,
      "text": "// SPINLOCK — mutual exclusion with XV6 spinlock\nrendezvous(worker_id);    // both CPUs are ready\n\nacquire(&demo.lock);      // only ONE CPU can proceed\npage = __atomic_load_n(&demo.freelist, __ATOMIC_RELAXED);\nif (page)\n    __atomic_store_n(&demo.freelist, page->next, __ATOMIC_RELAXED);\nrelease(&demo.lock);      // other CPU can now enter",
